Crystal Empire War of Independence

[l_english.EVENT_SUPER_1_DESC]
And lo, the blasphemer of the crystal ponies is in distress, for the gates of the Crystal Empire shall be tightly shut against them.

[l_english.EVENT_SUPER_1_MARK]
Glory To Empire!

[l_english.EVENT_SUPER_1_THREAT]
Crystal Empire War of Independence

[l_english.EVENT_SUPER_1_NEWS_NAME]
Crystal Empire War of Independence

[l_english.EVENT_SUPER_1_NEWS_DESC]
Since the royal cabinet and its supporters acquired an overwhelming majority in the Crystal Empire Council and the Crystal Empire promulgated the “Crystal Sacrament”, the Crystal Empire has been running on the road to religiousization. On the one hand, the “Sacrament” has brought the Crystal Empire back together, and the economy and love of the Crystal Empire have shown clear signs of recovery; on the other hand, encouraged by some doctrines of the “Sacrament”, the long-standing dissatisfaction of the crystal ponies with the changelings has been remarkably magnified, and the internal conflicts between the crystal ponies and the Changeling and Equestria Unity Commission have significantly escalated.
Finally, after the Crystal Empire Council passed the independence resolution with a high vote, the Crystal Empire announced that it would stop implementing the “Crystal Empire Ceasefire Agreement” and begin to expel the changelings from its territory. The independence of the Crystal Empire was immediately met with strong protests from the Changeling Empire, which declared that the independence of the Crystal Empire was illegal and that it was shameful to violate the “Ceasefire Agreement”; the Crystal Empire cited the “Sacrament” to justify the legitimacy of its independence. The event quickly escalated into a war. However, some analysts believe that the Changeling Empire is different from what it was several years ago, and internal conflicts are troubling it. Even though it has declared war on the Crystal Empire, the Changeling Empire may not go all out to take action, and may even fall into a worse predicament due to the lack of trade and resources from the Crystal Empire. The Equestria Empire strongly condemned the Crystal Empire’s tearing up of the “Ceasefire Agreement”, but has not yet clearly stated whether it will directly participate in the war.
In any case, the Crystal Empire War of Independence is a major challenge to the Canterlot PACT system and a huge gamble for the Crystal Empire. The world is waiting with bated breath for the Changeling Empire’s response.

[l_english.EVENT_SUPER_1_NEWS_o]
